"Hello, and thanks for joining. I'm reading this from the notch, right under the camera, so my eyes stay where they should.\n\nThe words move at a steady pace, and I can speed them up or slow them down with the arrow keys. Space pauses, and Escape closes the Prompter.\n\nThis window is hidden from screen sharing and recordings, so only I can see it. Everyone else just sees me looking at them.\n\nIn Voice mode the script follows me instead. I read at my own speed, Scout listens on this Mac, and the text keeps up with what I say. If I skip a line, it finds my place again.\n\nThat's all there is to it. Write your own script, press Start, and look into the lens." = "Sveiki un paldies, ka pievienojāties. Es to lasu no izgriezuma, tieši zem kameras, tāpēc manas acis paliek tur, kur vajag.\n\nVārdi virzās vienmērīgā tempā, un es varu tos paātrināt vai palēnināt ar bulttaustiņiem. Space aptur, un Escape aizver Prompteri.\n\nŠis logs ir paslēpts no ekrāna kopīgošanas un ierakstiem, tāpēc to redzu tikai es. Visi pārējie redz tikai to, ka es skatos uz viņiem.\n\nBalss režīmā skripts seko man. Es lasu savā tempā, Scout klausās šajā Mac datorā, un teksts seko tam, ko es saku. Ja izlaižu rindu, tas atkal atrod manu vietu.\n\nTas ir viss. Uzraksti savu skriptu, nospied Sākt un skaties objektīvā.";
